      "comment": "SURFERS ROYALE (7) gets the nod after two strong seconds. Last start, he missed by just over half a length in a Class 6 at Cloncurry while near the top of the betting. A close nose defeat to REVOLT here ties him into key local form, and the weight relief boosts his prospects. DEMITASSE (6) must bounce back from a poor Quality run, where he was over 12 lengths behind, but his BM70 fourth at Townsville was solid despite clear-running trouble, finishing just a length from Chartwell. REVOLT (2) can't be ignored after narrowly defeating SURFERS ROYALE as an odds-on favorite, and his Quality second at Birdsville shows he's in form. SHE SMASHES (4) has been costly lately, with excuses for her last two starts, including a bad jump and wide trip at Springsure. Her strong track and distance record makes her a contender if she starts well.",
